			"path": "ios/Classes/api/AlarmApiImpl.swift-simstep-954302fe-f27a-4920-8914-eaaca2bd2d15",
			"fileName": "AlarmApiImpl.swift",
			"wiki": "The native Swift `AlarmApiImpl` receives the call from Flutter and immediately delegates the task of setting the alarm to the `AlarmManager` class, which contains the core scheduling logic.",
			"cellName": "iOS Flow: Receive and Delegate to AlarmManager - AlarmApiImpl.swift:L13-22",
