		"ios/Classes/services/AlarmRingManager.swift-simstep-d890bbe5-f939-40ca-92e5-0c3cb7b25da0": {
			"path": "ios/Classes/services/AlarmRingManager.swift-simstep-d890bbe5-f939-40ca-92e5-0c3cb7b25da0",
			"fileName": "AlarmRingManager.swift",
			"wiki": "The `start` method in `AlarmRingManager` receives the `AVAudioPlayer`. It sets the `numberOfLoops` property based on the `loopAudio` boolean (if true, it's set to -1 for infinite looping; if false, it's 0). Finally, it calls `audioPlayer.play()` to start the ringtone.",
			"cellName": "Configure and Play Ringtone (iOS) - AlarmRingManager.swift:L43-54",
			"cellId": "824bb927-7225-4ba2-a5fd-eb68a023faac",
			"visible": true,
