			"fileName": "volume_settings.dart",
			"wiki": "Before being sent to native code, the `AlarmSettings` and `VolumeSettings` objects are converted into a simplified 'Wire' format. This involves converting complex Dart types, like `Duration`, into primitive types that can be easily serialized, such as an integer representing milliseconds.",
