			"fileName": "VolumeSettings.kt",
			"wiki": "On the native side, the received data is deserialized from its 'Wire' format back into a rich, platform-specific `VolumeSettings` model. This reconstructs complex types, like converting milliseconds back into a `Duration` (Kotlin) or `TimeInterval` (Swift).",
			"cellName": "Data Transformation: Wire Object to Native Model - VolumeSettings.kt:L15-21",
