			"fileName": "AlarmManager.swift",
			"wiki": "On iOS, a scheduled `Timer` fires, triggering the `ringAlarm` method in `AlarmManager`. This method looks up the alarm's configuration and then calls the `AlarmRingManager` to handle the audio playback and volume adjustments.",
