			"fileName": "AlarmSettings.kt",
			"wiki": "On the Android side, the platform channel receives the `AlarmSettingsWire` object. It is then deserialized into a native Kotlin `AlarmSettings` data class, making the `vibrate` flag accessible to the Android services.",
