		"7b1c465f-9112-471e-891f-257dc5510b8c": {
			"path": "7b1c465f-9112-471e-891f-257dc5510b8c",
			"cellName": "Alarm Ringing: Native Service Notifies Flutter - AlarmService.kt:L132-138",
			"cellId": "7b1c465f-9112-471e-891f-257dc5510b8c",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "00830dbd-8e42-4240-9477-4ae11f3e13e1"
		},
		"android/src/main/kotlin/com/gdelataillade/alarm/alarm/AlarmService.kt-simstep-502e535c-1b90-4e05-a46a-dd18d0f7c68e": {
			"path": "android/src/main/kotlin/com/gdelataillade/alarm/alarm/AlarmService.kt-simstep-502e535c-1b90-4e05-a46a-dd18d0f7c68e",
			"fileName": "AlarmService.kt",
			"wiki": "At the scheduled time, the native Android `AlarmService` is started. It handles playing the alarm sound and vibrations. To enable real-time UI updates, it invokes the `alarmRang` method via a Pigeon message channel, sending the ringing alarm's ID to the Flutter application.",
			"cellName": "Alarm Ringing: Native Service Notifies Flutter - AlarmService.kt:L132-138",
			"cellId": "7b1c465f-9112-471e-891f-257dc5510b8c",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 132,
			"endLine": 138,
			"parentCellId": "00830dbd-8e42-4240-9477-4ae11f3e13e1",
			"parentPath": "android/src/main/kotlin/com/gdelataillade/alarm/alarm/AlarmService.kt",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Allow the app to react in real-time to alarm events like ringing or being stopped.",
					"simStepId": "502e535c-1b90-4e05-a46a-dd18d0f7c68e"
				}
			]
		},
		"4acf96f1-ab79-4f27-b955-6ef962e8d07e": {
			"path": "4acf96f1-ab79-4f27-b955-6ef962e8d07e",
			"cellName": "Alarm Ringing: Dart Receives Native Call - alarm_trigger_api_impl.dart:L46-54",
			"cellId": "4acf96f1-ab79-4f27-b955-6ef962e8d07e",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "ac8abb6f-1c2c-4169-bba4-3b04c56a4707"
		},
		"lib/src/alarm_trigger_api_impl.dart-simstep-696e72a2-cd17-4d9c-a817-60bf8f29efb6": {
			"path": "lib/src/alarm_trigger_api_impl.dart-simstep-696e72a2-cd17-4d9c-a817-60bf8f29efb6",
			"fileName": "alarm_trigger_api_impl.dart",
			"wiki": "The Pigeon setup in the Dart code receives the `alarmRang` call. The `AlarmTriggerApiImpl` class, which implements the Flutter-side of the API, handles the incoming message. It uses the received `alarmId` to fetch the full alarm details from storage.",
			"cellName": "Alarm Ringing: Dart Receives Native Call - alarm_trigger_api_impl.dart:L46-54",
			"cellId": "4acf96f1-ab79-4f27-b955-6ef962e8d07e",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 46,
			"endLine": 54,
			"parentCellId": "ac8abb6f-1c2c-4169-bba4-3b04c56a4707",
			"parentPath": "lib/src/alarm_trigger_api_impl.dart",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Allow the app to react in real-time to alarm events like ringing or being stopped.",
					"simStepId": "696e72a2-cd17-4d9c-a817-60bf8f29efb6"
				}
			]
		},
		"9f964b60-974f-480a-8a3b-de8b411f97cf": {
			"path": "9f964b60-974f-480a-8a3b-de8b411f97cf",
			"cellName": "Alarm Ringing: Update Alarm State Streams - alarm.dart:L249-253",
			"cellId": "9f964b60-974f-480a-8a3b-de8b411f97cf",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "4e0798c7-e641-49c0-a5a6-1e52a1aade60"
		},
		"lib/alarm.dart-simstep-21b6418a-a3ef-4fd5-912d-b5b330cc519e": {
			"path": "lib/alarm.dart-simstep-21b6418a-a3ef-4fd5-912d-b5b330cc519e",
			"fileName": "alarm.dart",
			"wiki": "The `Alarm.alarmRang` method is executed as the callback. It updates the application's state by removing the alarm from the `_scheduled` stream and adding it to the `_ringing` stream, which is a `BehaviorSubject` that holds the set of currently ringing alarms.",
			"cellName": "Alarm Ringing: Update Alarm State Streams - alarm.dart:L249-253",
			"cellId": "9f964b60-974f-480a-8a3b-de8b411f97cf",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 249,
			"endLine": 253,
			"parentCellId": "4e0798c7-e641-49c0-a5a6-1e52a1aade60",
			"parentPath": "lib/alarm.dart",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Allow the app to react in real-time to alarm events like ringing or being stopped.",
					"simStepId": "21b6418a-a3ef-4fd5-912d-b5b330cc519e"
				}
			]
		},
		"eacbe3b9-8d83-4025-b4c1-638f9dc0309f": {
			"path": "eacbe3b9-8d83-4025-b4c1-638f9dc0309f",
			"cellName": "Alarm Ringing: UI Reacts and Navigates - home.dart:L52-60",
			"cellId": "eacbe3b9-8d83-4025-b4c1-638f9dc0309f",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "8f6ee7dd-f9ad-4565-996b-544eb463d8fa"
		},
		"example/lib/screens/home.dart-simstep-48a9d1d9-ec6d-4159-9397-1a3864675153": {
			"path": "example/lib/screens/home.dart-simstep-48a9d1d9-ec6d-4159-9397-1a3864675153",
			"fileName": "home.dart",
			"wiki": "In the example app's home screen, a `StreamSubscription` listening to `Alarm.ringing` receives the new `AlarmSet`. The callback `ringingAlarmsChanged` is triggered, which then navigates to a dedicated `ExampleAlarmRingScreen` to display the ringing UI.",
			"cellName": "Alarm Ringing: UI Reacts and Navigates - home.dart:L52-60",
			"cellId": "eacbe3b9-8d83-4025-b4c1-638f9dc0309f",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 52,
			"endLine": 60,
			"parentCellId": "8f6ee7dd-f9ad-4565-996b-544eb463d8fa",
			"parentPath": "example/lib/screens/home.dart",
			"simSteps": [
