			"fileName": "ring.dart",
			"wiki": "The `ExampleAlarmRingScreen` has its own listener to the `Alarm.ringing` stream. When it receives the updated `AlarmSet` and sees that its alarm's ID is no longer present, it concludes the alarm has been stopped and calls `Navigator.pop(context)` to return to the previous screen.",
			"cellName": "Alarm Stopping: UI Reacts and Pops Screen - ring.dart:L24-29",
			"cellId": "c2f2bc18-9163-4741-889f-b133d3f4be38",
