		"lib/src/base_alarm.dart-simstep-f819d130-95f7-47e0-8390-a5bf0236db52": {
			"path": "lib/src/base_alarm.dart-simstep-f819d130-95f7-47e0-8390-a5bf0236db52",
			"fileName": "base_alarm.dart",
			"wiki": "The `stopAll` method in the `BaseAlarm` class is called. It first stops any Dart-side timers via `PlatformTimers.stopAll()` and then uses the Pigeon-generated `api.stopAll()` method to send a request to the native platform code.",
			"cellName": "Dart: Invoke Native API via BaseAlarm - base_alarm.dart:L65-68",
			"cellId": "bd9007f1-1cb7-43ac-8862-65756bbeb5db",
