			"description": "<ul><li>A simple boolean flag (<code>vibrate</code>) in <code>AlarmSettings</code> controls whether the device vibrates when an alarm rings</li><li>Vibration repeats indefinitely alongside the audio until the alarm is stopped</li><li>This feature works in various device states, including silent mode</li></ul>",
