					"simStepLabel": "Alarm Ringing: Native Service Notifies Flutter",
					"simStepDescription": "At the scheduled time, the native Android `AlarmService` is started. It handles playing the alarm sound and vibrations. To enable real-time UI updates, it invokes the `alarmRang` method via a Pigeon message channel, sending the ringing alarm's ID to the Flutter application.",
