			"description": "<ul><li>Exposes streams like <code>Alarm</li><li>ringing</code> and <code>Alarm</li><li>scheduled</code> that developers can subscribe to</li><li>This enables building custom UI, such as navigating to a dedicated ringing screen when an alarm starts</li><li>The app's UI can be automatically updated when an alarm is set, updated, or stopped</li></ul>",
