				}
			],
			"description": "<ul><li>On iOS, where alarms cannot fire if the app is force-quit, the plugin can show a warning notification to the user at the moment the app is terminated</li><li>This <code>warningNotificationOnKill</code> feature helps manage user expectations regarding platform limitations</li></ul>",
